{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>想帶小朋友學滑雪又不知從何入手？來到這個富士山下的滑雪場就對了！這裡不僅風景絕美，而且大人小朋友的滑雪服裝和裝備都可以直接租借，一家人兩手空空就能輕鬆出發，非常適合新手和家庭旅客。\n</p>\n<p>留言「🗻」，即刻 send 完整滑雪行程詳細資料比你！</p>\n<p>好動旅人 ｜ 旅遊不止食買玩，用跑步、潛水或滑雪等活動探索世界，在運動的節奏裡，發現每個地方最真實的風景。邊一場戶外旅程令你最難忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的冒險故事！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179457129064753219_16851422836af6fc1b78302.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179457129064753219_16851422836af6fc1b78302.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@hazel_lucasbb)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfrZhyIz-sl/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%af%8c%e5%a3%ab%e5%b1%b1%e6%bb%91%e9%9b%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">富士山滑雪</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%96%b0%e6%89%8b%e6%bb%91%e9%9b%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新手滑雪</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%a6%aa%e5%ad%90%e6%bb%91%e9%9b%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子滑雪</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@hazel_lucasbb資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfrZhyIz-sl/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.281707+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:11.327971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:43.717917+00:00","content_hash":"00c01ad699bb4402b87df8f95a6f8a56649725b9204145980cedb248b873ee6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}